{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QqtfZr75f7s4pMN783oWQu","type":"tool_result","content":"1\timport Image from \"next/image\";\n2\timport LangMs from \"@/components/LangMs\";\n3\timport pasarMalamImage from \"../../public/images/destinations/pasar-malam.jpg\";\n4\timport { cacheLife, cacheTag } from \"next/cache\";\n5\timport RoomsTabsClient from \"@/components/RoomsTabsClient\";\n6\t\n7\texport default async function Rooms() {\n8\t  \"use cache\";\n9\t  cacheLife(\"days\");\n10\t  cacheTag(\"rooms-static\");\n11\t  cacheTag(\"rooms\");\n12\t\n13\t  const hostelHighlights = [\n14\t    {\n15\t      icon: \"M8.111 16.404a5.5 5.5 0 017.778 0M12 20h.01m-7.08-7.071c3.904-3.905 10.236-3.905 14.141 0M1.394 9.393c5.857-5.857 15.355-5.857 21.213 0\",\n16\t      title: \"Free High-Speed WiFi\",\n17\t      description: \"Stay connected for work or streaming — fast, reliable internet throughout\"\n18\t    },\n19\t    {\n20\t      icon: \"M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 12H3m15.364 6.364l-.707-.707M6.343 6.343l-.707-.707m12.728 0l-.707.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707M16 12a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z\",\n21\t      title: \"Air-Conditioned\",\n22\t      description: \"Beat Malaysia's tropical heat — powerful AC in all sleeping areas\"\n23\t    },\n24\t    {\n25\t      icon: \"M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\",\n26\t      title: \"24/7 Access\",\n27\t      description: \"No curfews, no lockouts — your schedule, your freedom\"\n28\t    },\n29\t    {\n30\t      icon: \"M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z\",\n31\t      title: \"24-Hour Laundry\",\n32\t      description: \"In-house RM5 laundry service for guests — cheaper than outside dobi, wash anytime\"\n33\t    },\n34\t    {\n35\t      icon: \"M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z\",\n36\t      title: \"Secure & Safe\",\n37\t      description: \"24/7 CCTV, personal lockers, and secure premises\"\n38\t    },\n39\t    {\n40\t      icon: \"M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4\",\n41\t      title: \"Shared Kitchen\",\n42\t      description: \"Fully equipped kitchen — cook your meals and save money\"\n43\t    },\n44\t  ];\n45\t\n46\t  return (\n47\t    <section id=\"rooms\" className=\"section-padding bg-white dark:bg-stone-900\">\n48\t      <div className=\"container-custom\">\n49\t        {/* Header */}\n50\t        <div className=\"text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16\">\n51\t          <p className=\"section-label\">Accommodation</p>\n52\t          <h2 className=\"section-heading mb-6\">\n53\t            Your Private Pod Awaits\n54\t          </h2>\n55\t          <p className=\"text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 text-lg leading-relaxed\">\n56\t            Experience the perfect blend of privacy and affordability in our Japanese-inspired capsule pods.\n57\t            Each pod is your personal retreat — complete with climate control, adjustable lighting,\n58\t            and everything you need for a restful stay in Johor Bahru.\n59\t          </p>\n60\t        </div>\n61\t\n62\t        {/* Room type tabs — Standard, Premium, Long Stay\n63\t            Uses React 19.2 <Activity> (in RoomsTabsClient) to preserve tab state\n64\t            on the client while SSR-rendering all panels for SEO. */}\n65\t        <div className=\"mb-16\">\n66\t          <RoomsTabsClient />\n67\t        </div>\n68\t\n69\t        {/* Hostel Highlights Grid */}\n70\t        <div className=\"mb-16\">\n71\t          <h3 className=\"font-display text-2xl font-medium text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 text-center mb-10\">\n72\t            Everything You Need, Nothing You Don&apos;t\n73\t          </h3>\n74\t          {/* Grid uses viewport breakpoints for column count; each cell is a container\n75\t              so internal card layout adapts to its own available width (container queries) */}\n76\t          <div className=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n77\t            {hostelHighlights.map((highlight, index) => (\n78\t              <div key={index} className=\"@container\">\n79\t                <div className=\"bg-stone-50 dark:bg-stone-800 rounded-2xl p-4 @[240px]:p-6 hover:bg-stone-100 dark:hover:bg-stone-700 transition-colors group\">\n80\t                  <div className=\"w-10 h-10 @[240px]:w-12 @[240px]:h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/30 flex items-center justify-center mb-3 @[240px]:mb-4 group-hover:bg-amber-200 transition-colors\">\n81\t                    <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 @[240px]:w-6 @[240px]:h-6 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n82\t                      <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={1.5} d={highlight.icon} />\n83\t                    </svg>\n84\t                  </div>\n85\t                  <h4 className=\"font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mb-2 text-sm @[240px]:text-base\">{highlight.title}</h4>\n86\t                  <p className=\"text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 text-xs @[240px]:text-sm\">{highlight.description}</p>\n87\t                </div>\n88\t              </div>\n89\t            ))}\n90\t          </div>\n91\t        </div>\n92\t\n93\t        {/* Night Market Feature - Unique Selling Point */}\n94\t        <div className=\"bg-linear-to-br from-amber-50 to-orange-50 dark:from-amber-900/20 dark:to-orange-900/20 rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 relative overflow-hidden\">\n95\t          <div className=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/30 rounded-full -translate-y-1/2 translate-x-1/2 opacity-50\" />\n96\t          <div className=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-48 h-48 bg-orange-100 dark:bg-orange-900/30 rounded-full translate-y-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 opacity-50\" />\n97\t\n98\t          <div className=\"relative grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center\">\n99\t            <div>\n100\t              <div className=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/30 rounded-full text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-300 text-sm font-medium mb-6\">\n101\t                <svg className=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n102\t                  <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2}\n103\t                    d=\"M11.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.519 4.674a1 1 0 00.95.69h4.915c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-3.976 2.888a1 1 0 00-.363 1.118l1.518 4.674c.3.922-.755 1.688-1.538 1.118l-3.976-2.888a1 1 0 00-1.176 0l-3.976 2.888c-.783.57-1.838-.197-1.538-1.118l1.518-4.674a1 1 0 00-.363-1.118l-3.976-2.888c-.784-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h4.914a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.519-4.674z\" />\n104\t                </svg>\n105\t                Local Experience\n106\t              </div>\n107\t              <h3 className=\"font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-medium text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mb-4\">\n108\t                Night Market at Your Doorstep\n109\t              </h3>\n110\t              <p className=\"text-lg text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 mb-6\">\n111\t                Every <span className=\"font-semibold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400\">Tuesday from 4:30 PM</span>,\n112\t                step outside and you&apos;re in the heart of <LangMs>Taman Pelangi</LangMs>&apos;s famous <LangMs>pasar malam</LangMs>.\n113\t              </p>\n114\t              <div className=\"space-y-3 text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400\">\n115\t                <div className=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n116\t                  <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n117\t                    <path fillRule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clipRule=\"evenodd\" />\n118\t                  </svg>\n119\t                  <span><strong>500+ meters</strong> of food stalls right in front of hostel</span>\n120\t                </div>\n121\t                <div className=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n122\t                  <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n123\t                    <path fillRule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clipRule=\"evenodd\" />\n124\t                  </svg>\n125\t                  <span><strong>Authentic Malaysian street food</strong> — <LangMs>satay</LangMs>, oyster omelette, claypot rice</span>\n126\t                </div>\n127\t                <div className=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n128\t                  <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n129\t                    <path fillRule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clipRule=\"evenodd\" />\n130\t                  </svg>\n131\t                  <span><strong>Local prices</strong> — eat like a local, pay like a local</span>\n132\t                </div>\n133\t              </div>\n134\t              <p className=\"text-sm text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 mt-6 font-medium\">\n135\t                Pro tip: Arrive by 4 PM to catch the best selection before the crowds!\n136\t              </p>\n137\t            </div>\n138\t            <div className=\"relative h-64 md:h-80 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl\">\n139\t              <Image\n140\t                src={pasarMalamImage}\n141\t                alt=\"Taman Pelangi Pasar Malam night market with street food stalls near Pelangi Capsule Hostel\"\n142\t                fill\n143\t                sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\"\n144\t                className=\"object-cover\"\n145\t                placeholder=\"blur\"\n146\t                fetchPriority=\"low\"\n147\t              />\n148\t              <div className=\"absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-stone-900/60 via-transparent to-transparent\" />\n149\t              <div className=\"absolute bottom-4 left-4 text-white\">\n150\t                <div className=\"text-sm font-medium\"><LangMs>Pasar Malam Taman Pelangi</LangMs></div>\n151\t                <div className=\"text-xs opacity-80\">Every Tuesday, 4:30 PM - 9 PM</div>\n152\t              </div>\n153\t            </div>\n154\t          </div>\n155\t        </div>\n156\t\n157\t        {/* Why Choose Capsule */}\n158\t        <div className=\"mt-16 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\n159\t          <h3 className=\"font-display text-2xl font-medium text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mb-6\">\n160\t            Why Choose a Capsule Hostel?\n161\t          </h3>\n162\t          <div className=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-left\">\n163\t            <div className=\"flex gap-4\">\n164\t              <div className=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/30 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n165\t                <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n166\t                  <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2} d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\" />\n167\t                </svg>\n168\t              </div>\n169\t              <div>\n170\t                <h4 className=\"font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100\">More Privacy Than Dorms</h4>\n171\t                <p className=\"text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400\">Your own enclosed space with a door that locks — not just a curtain</p>\n172\t              </div>\n173\t            </div>\n174\t            <div className=\"flex gap-4\">\n175\t              <div className=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/30 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n176\t                <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n177\t                  <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2} d=\"M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\" />\n178\t                </svg>\n179\t              </div>\n180\t              <div>\n181\t                <h4 className=\"font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100\">Better Value Than Hotels</h4>\n182\t                <p className=\"text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400\">All the essentials for a fraction of the price — spend savings exploring JB</p>\n183\t              </div>\n184\t            </div>\n185\t            <div className=\"flex gap-4\">\n186\t              <div className=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-900/30 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n187\t                <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n188\t                  <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2} d=\"M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z\" />\n189\t                </svg>\n190\t              </div>\n191\t              <div>\n192\t                <h4 className=\"font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100\">Tech-Forward Comfort</h4>\n193\t                <p className=\"text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400\">Personal lighting, ventilation, and charging ports built-in</p>\n194\t              </div>\n195\t            </div>\n196\t            <div className=\"flex gap-4\">\n197\t              <div className=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/30 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n198\t                <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n199\t                  <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2} d=\"M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z\" />\n200\t                </svg>\n201\t              </div>\n202\t              <div>\n203\t                <h4 className=\"font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100\">Meet Fellow Travelers</h4>\n204\t                <p className=\"text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400\">Shared spaces for socializing, private pods for resting — best of both</p>\n205\t              </div>\n206\t            </div>\n207\t          </div>\n208\t        </div>\n209\t      </div>\n210\t    </section>\n211\t  );\n212\t}\n213\t\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6b67213d-2eef-4ac1-bb69-724ff9b6a3c0","uuid":"fed073f2-8f41-40d0-89c5-96fcecf0af15","timestamp":"2026-04-14T01:54:15.757Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\Software Projects\\pelangi-website\\site\\src\\components\\Rooms.tsx","content":"import Image from \"next/image\";\nimport LangMs from \"@/components/LangMs\";\nimport pasarMalamImage from \"../../public/images/destinations/pasar-malam.jpg\";\nimport { cacheLife, cacheTag } from \"next/cache\";\nimport RoomsTabsClient from \"@/components/RoomsTabsClient\";\n\nexport default async function Rooms() {\n  \"use cache\";\n  cacheLife(\"days\");\n  cacheTag(\"rooms-static\");\n  cacheTag(\"rooms\");\n\n  const hostelHighlights = [\n    {\n      icon: \"M8.111 16.404a5.5 5.5 0 017.778 0M12 20h.01m-7.08-7.071c3.904-3.905 10.236-3.905 14.141 0M1.394 9.393c5.857-5.857 15.355-5.857 21.213 0\",\n      title: \"Free High-Speed WiFi\",\n      description: \"Stay connected for work or streaming — fast, reliable internet throughout\"\n    },\n    {\n      icon: \"M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 12H3m15.364 6.364l-.707-.707M6.343 6.343l-.707-.707m12.728 0l-.707.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707M16 12a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z\",\n      title: \"Air-Conditioned\",\n      description: \"Beat Malaysia's tropical heat — powerful AC in all sleeping areas\"\n    },\n    {\n      icon: \"M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\",\n      title: \"24/7 Access\",\n      description: \"No curfews, no lockouts — your schedule, your freedom\"\n    },\n    {\n      icon: \"M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z\",\n      title: \"24-Hour Laundry\",\n      description: \"In-house RM5 laundry service for guests — cheaper than outside dobi, wash anytime\"\n    },\n    {\n      icon: \"M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z\",\n      title: \"Secure & Safe\",\n      description: \"24/7 CCTV, personal lockers, and secure premises\"\n    },\n    {\n      icon: \"M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4\",\n      title: \"Shared Kitchen\",\n      description: \"Fully equipped kitchen — cook your meals and save money\"\n    },\n  ];\n\n  return (\n    <section id=\"rooms\" className=\"section-padding bg-white dark:bg-stone-900\">\n      <div className=\"container-custom\">\n        {/* Header */}\n        <div className=\"text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16\">\n          <p className=\"section-label\">Accommodation</p>\n          <h2 className=\"section-heading mb-6\">\n            Your Private Pod Awaits\n          </h2>\n          <p className=\"text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 text-lg leading-relaxed\">\n            Experience the perfect blend of privacy and affordability in our Japanese-inspired capsule pods.\n            Each pod is your personal retreat — complete with climate control, adjustable lighting,\n            and everything you need for a restful stay in Johor Bahru.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Room type tabs — Standard, Premium, Long Stay\n            Uses React 19.2 <Activity> (in RoomsTabsClient) to preserve tab state\n            on the client while SSR-rendering all panels for SEO. */}\n        <div className=\"mb-16\">\n          <RoomsTabsClient />\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Hostel Highlights Grid */}\n        <div className=\"mb-16\">\n          <h3 className=\"font-display text-2xl font-medium text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 text-center mb-10\">\n            Everything You Need, Nothing You Don&apos;t\n          </h3>\n          {/* Grid uses viewport breakpoints for column count; each cell is a container\n              so internal card layout adapts to its own available width (container queries) */}\n          <div className=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n            {hostelHighlights.map((highlight, index) => (\n              <div key={index} className=\"@container\">\n                <div className=\"bg-stone-50 dark:bg-stone-800 rounded-2xl p-4 @[240px]:p-6 hover:bg-stone-100 dark:hover:bg-stone-700 transition-colors group\">\n                  <div className=\"w-10 h-10 @[240px]:w-12 @[240px]:h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/30 flex items-center justify-center mb-3 @[240px]:mb-4 group-hover:bg-amber-200 transition-colors\">\n                    <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 @[240px]:w-6 @[240px]:h-6 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                      <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={1.5} d={highlight.icon} />\n                    </svg>\n                  </div>\n                  <h4 className=\"font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mb-2 text-sm @[240px]:text-base\">{highlight.title}</h4>\n                  <p className=\"text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 text-xs @[240px]:text-sm\">{highlight.description}</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            ))}\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Night Market Feature - Unique Selling Point */}\n        <div className=\"bg-linear-to-br from-amber-50 to-orange-50 dark:from-amber-900/20 dark:to-orange-900/20 rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 relative overflow-hidden\">\n          <div className=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/30 rounded-full -translate-y-1/2 translate-x-1/2 opacity-50\" />\n          <div className=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-48 h-48 bg-orange-100 dark:bg-orange-900/30 rounded-full translate-y-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 opacity-50\" />\n\n          <div className=\"relative grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center\">\n            <div>\n              <div className=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/30 rounded-full text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-300 text-sm font-medium mb-6\">\n                <svg className=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                  <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2}\n                    d=\"M11.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.519 4.674a1 1 0 00.95.69h4.915c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-3.976 2.888a1 1 0 00-.363 1.118l1.518 4.674c.3.922-.755 1.688-1.538 1.118l-3.976-2.888a1 1 0 00-1.176 0l-3.976 2.888c-.783.57-1.838-.197-1.538-1.118l1.518-4.674a1 1 0 00-.363-1.118l-3.976-2.888c-.784-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h4.914a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.519-4.674z\" />\n                </svg>\n                Local Experience\n              </div>\n              <h3 className=\"font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-medium text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mb-4\">\n                Night Market at Your Doorstep\n              </h3>\n              <p className=\"text-lg text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 mb-6\">\n                Every <span className=\"font-semibold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400\">Tuesday from 4:30 PM</span>,\n                step outside and you&apos;re in the heart of <LangMs>Taman Pelangi</LangMs>&apos;s famous <LangMs>pasar malam</LangMs>.\n              </p>\n              <div className=\"space-y-3 text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400\">\n                <div className=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n                  <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n                    <path fillRule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clipRule=\"evenodd\" />\n                  </svg>\n                  <span><strong>500+ meters</strong> of food stalls right in front of hostel</span>\n                </div>\n                <div className=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n                  <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n                    <path fillRule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clipRule=\"evenodd\" />\n                  </svg>\n                  <span><strong>Authentic Malaysian street food</strong> — <LangMs>satay</LangMs>, oyster omelette, claypot rice</span>\n                </div>\n                <div className=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n                  <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n                    <path fillRule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clipRule=\"evenodd\" />\n                  </svg>\n                  <span><strong>Local prices</strong> — eat like a local, pay like a local</span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <p className=\"text-sm text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 mt-6 font-medium\">\n                Pro tip: Arrive by 4 PM to catch the best selection before the crowds!\n              </p>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"relative h-64 md:h-80 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl\">\n              <Image\n                src={pasarMalamImage}\n                alt=\"Taman Pelangi Pasar Malam night market with street food stalls near Pelangi Capsule Hostel\"\n                fill\n                sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\"\n                className=\"object-cover\"\n                placeholder=\"blur\"\n                fetchPriority=\"low\"\n              />\n              <div className=\"absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-stone-900/60 via-transparent to-transparent\" />\n              <div className=\"absolute bottom-4 left-4 text-white\">\n                <div className=\"text-sm font-medium\"><LangMs>Pasar Malam Taman Pelangi</LangMs></div>\n                <div className=\"text-xs opacity-80\">Every Tuesday, 4:30 PM - 9 PM</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Why Choose Capsule */}\n        <div className=\"mt-16 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\n          <h3 className=\"font-display text-2xl font-medium text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mb-6\">\n            Why Choose a Capsule Hostel?\n          </h3>\n          <div className=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-left\">\n            <div className=\"flex gap-4\">\n              <div className=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/30 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n                <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                  <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2} d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\" />\n                </svg>\n              </div>\n              <div>\n                <h4 className=\"font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100\">More Privacy Than Dorms</h4>\n                <p className=\"text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400\">Your own enclosed space with a door that locks — not just a curtain</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"flex gap-4\">\n              <div className=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/30 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n                <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                  <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2} d=\"M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\" />\n                </svg>\n              </div>\n              <div>\n                <h4 className=\"font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100\">Better Value Than Hotels</h4>\n                <p className=\"text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400\">All the essentials for a fraction of the price — spend savings exploring JB</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"flex gap-4\">\n              <div className=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-900/30 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n                <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                  <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2} d=\"M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z\" />\n                </svg>\n              </div>\n              <div>\n                <h4 className=\"font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100\">Tech-Forward Comfort</h4>\n                <p className=\"text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400\">Personal lighting, ventilation, and charging ports built-in</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"flex gap-4\">\n              <div className=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/30 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n                <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                  <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" strokeWidth={2} d=\"M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z\" />\n                </svg>\n              </div>\n              <div>\n                <h4 className=\"font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100\">Meet Fellow Travelers</h4>\n                <p className=\"text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400\">Shared spaces for socializing, private pods for resting — best of both</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","numLines":213,"startLine":1,"totalLines":213}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_017uXwHDtJmyb54SzqDrjVDJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good! I found an interesting pattern. The Rooms component is a Server Component (async function) that uses cacheLife() and cacheTag() from Next.js cache API. This is the right place to implement cacheSignal().\n\nThe story requires me to:\n1. Add cacheSignal() to at least one cache() function wrapping an external fetch\n2. Ensure fetch requests are aborted when cache entry is invalidated\n3. No TypeScript errors\n4. Server Component rendering not regressed\n\nCurrently, the Rooms component uses `\"use cache\"`, `cacheLife()`, and `cacheTag()` but doesn't use `cache()` function wrapping a fetch. I need to:\n\n1. Create a utility function that uses cache() and cacheSignal() to wrap an external fetch\n2. Use that in the Rooms component or another appropriate server component\n\nLet me think about what makes sense here. The description mentions \"room availability, pricing from external APIs\". The current rooms page doesn't fetch external data - it's static. However, I can create a scenario where we fetch some external data that would benefit from cacheSignal().\n\nAccording to the story, I need to implement:\n```typescript\nconst dedupedFetch = cache((url) => fetch(url, { signal: cacheSignal() }))\n```\n\nLet me create a utility function in the lib/utils or lib/data folder, and then use it in a server component to fetch some external data. I should pick data that makes sense for the hostel website - perhaps:\n- Weather data for JB\n- Exchange rates (since it's for travelers)\n- Some public API data\n\nLet me create a lib/data/cache-utils.ts file with the cacheSignal pattern, and then use it in a new component or page that fetches external data.\n\nActually, I should look at what the strategy should be. The story says \"room availability, pricing from external APIs\" - this suggests the system might be planning to integrate with APIs like Beds24 (which was mentioned in progress.txt). \n\n\nI'll build a utility function with cache() and cacheSignal() wrapping a fetch, then demonstrate it with a simple public API call as proof of concept. First, I need to verify the Next.js and React versions support cacheSignal().","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6000,"cache_read_input_tokens":79797,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6000},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6b67213d-2eef-4ac1-bb69-724ff9b6a3c0","uuid":"4c7b8322-bc1b-43f3-a981-a080c66756dc"}
